		<a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Calculator</a>
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p>GridPermit is committed to privacy. Our calculator does not require or collect personally identifiable information (PII) such as your name, email address, or phone number.</p>

		<p><strong>Session Data Processing:</strong> Inputs entered into our calculator (ZIP code and monthly bill amount) are processed locally in your web browser session to calculate estimated utility baseline metrics.</p>

		<p><strong>External Marketplace Redirects:</strong> When clicking external links to request quotes, you interact directly with third-party marketplaces governed by their respective privacy practices.</p>
